---
// Illustrated (not to scale) map of the Munduk highlands: where the hikes happen.
---
<figure class="area-map">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 400" role="img" aria-labelledby="map-title map-desc">
    <title id="map-title">Map of the Munduk hiking area</title>
    <desc id="map-desc">Illustrated map, not to scale. Munduk village sits north-west of Lake Tamblingan. Lake Buyan lies just east of Tamblingan, separated by a forested ridge. Munduk's waterfalls are in the valleys around the village.</desc>
    <rect width="640" height="400" fill="#E5ECE6" />
    <g fill="none" stroke="#C3D2C7" stroke-width="1.2">
      <path d="M40 330c80-60 180-40 260-90s180-130 300-120" />
      <path d="M20 290c90-70 190-50 270-100s190-140 330-130" />
      <path d="M60 370c100-40 200-20 290-70s170-110 280-100" />
      <path d="M220 230c40-60 140-90 220-70s110 80 60 120-170 50-230 20-70-30-50-70z" />
      <path d="M250 232c30-40 110-60 170-46s80 54 44 82-126 34-170 14-54-22-44-50z" />
    </g>
    <path d="M255 210c18-28 72-36 92-14s4 54-30 58-80-16-62-44z" fill="#2C6E7F" />
    <path d="M370 200c26-36 108-40 132-10s-2 70-48 74-112-24-84-64z" fill="#2C6E7F" />
    <path d="M330 220 C345 205 352 200 375 205" fill="none" stroke="#1E3B2C" stroke-width="10" opacity=".25" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M170 120 C210 150 240 175 270 205 S330 235 350 222 S400 210 430 230" fill="none" stroke="#E4572E" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-dasharray="2 9" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M150 112 C120 140 100 170 92 205" fill="none" stroke="#E4572E" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-dasharray="2 9" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <g font-family="Source Sans 3, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15" fill="#151B17">
      <circle cx="160" cy="112" r="8" fill="#1E3B2C" />
      <text x="174" y="100" font-weight="700">Munduk village</text>
      <g fill="#E4572E"><path d="M86 210l6-12 6 12z" /><path d="M110 236l6-12 6 12z" /></g>
      <text x="40" y="262" font-weight="600">Waterfalls</text>
      <text x="262" y="276" font-weight="700" fill="#1E3B2C">Lake Tamblingan</text>
      <text x="420" y="292" font-weight="700" fill="#1E3B2C">Lake Buyan</text>
      <text x="300" y="180" font-size="13" fill="#4D5A52">forest ridge</text>
      <path d="M250 205l5-14 5 14z" fill="#1E3B2C" />
      <text x="190" y="214" font-size="13" fill="#4D5A52">temple</text>
      <text x="560" y="350" font-size="13" fill="#4D5A52" text-anchor="end">To Bedugul &amp; Ubud →</text>
      <text x="40" y="40" font-size="13" fill="#4D5A52">↑ North · Lovina</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Illustrated map, not to scale. Dotted lines show typical hiking routes; Ketut confirms the exact route for your day.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .area-map { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  figcaption { font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--muted); }
</style>
